  "description": "Reads compiled .NET assemblies and their portable PDBs to answer \"where is this symbol / what calls it\" - symbol lookup, hover info, go-to-definition and find-references, resolving straight back to real source file:line via debug sequence points. No build, no workspace, no decompiler. This is the library; see the `dotnet-assembly-query` global tool for the CLI.",
